{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Your arm</b> — the strength of Your arm." "<b>To the generation</b> — to come." "<b>To all who come</b> — to all who shall come. The sense: that will be born, as in: 'One generation goes and another generation comes.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 71, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:52.727319819Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}